menu "Energy-aware Huffman coding"
    depends on USEMODULE_HUFFMAN_EE

config HUFFMAN_EE_MAX_SYMBOLS
    int "Maximum number of symbols in one table"
    default 256
    range 1 32767
    help
        Largest alphabet a huffman_ee table can hold. The build functions
        need about 16 bytes of stack per symbol, and the exact builders
        about 60 bytes per symbol.

endmenu # Energy-aware Huffman coding
